<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'44px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'126px', justifyContent:'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize:13, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#185FA5', letterSpacing:1.6 }}>01 · 기획</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize:40, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:10, lineHeight:1.1 }}>수업은 주 1회, 그런데 아이는 매일 오지 않는다</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize:18, color:'#64748B', marginTop:8 }}>기업이 제시한 문제</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'1px', background:'#E3EAF2' }} />
  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'456px', marginTop:'18px' }}>

    <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'168px', background:'#0E2438', borderRadius:18, padding:'28px 34px', justifyContent:'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:27, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#FFFFFF', lineHeight:1.45 }}>"수업이 없는 날에는 아이가</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:27, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#FFFFFF', lineHeight:1.45 }}>DOROBUS에 들어올 이유가 없습니다."</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:15, color:'#9FB6CC', marginTop:10 }}>— 2026. 09. 28 기업 피드백</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'252px', marginTop:20, flexDirection:'row', gap:16 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex:1, background:'#FDF2F2', borderRadius:16, padding:'24px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize:22, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#A32D2D' }}>①</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize:22, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:8 }}>접속 동기 없음</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize:17, color:'#4A3030', marginTop:12, lineHeight:1.6 }}>수업은 주 1회.<br/>나머지 6일은 이유가 없다.</Text>
        </Box><Box style={{ flex:1, background:'#FDF2F2', borderRadius:16, padding:'24px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize:22, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#A32D2D' }}>②</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize:22, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:8 }}>셀 획득처 편중</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize:17, color:'#4A3030', marginTop:12, lineHeight:1.6 }}>셀은 수업·과제·타자 1등뿐.<br/>소비처에 비해 좁다.</Text>
        </Box><Box style={{ flex:1, background:'#FDF2F2', borderRadius:16, padding:'24px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize:22, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#A32D2D' }}>③</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize:22, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:8 }}>성장 실감 부족</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize:17, color:'#4A3030', marginTop:12, lineHeight:1.6 }}>"어제보다 나아졌다"를<br/>눈으로 확인할 장치가 약하다.</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'28px', marginTop:14, flexDirection:'row', justifyContent:'space-between', alignItems:'center' }}>
